  "body": "## [0.1.20] - 2026-04-25\r\n\r\n### 🚀 Features\r\n\r\n- *(config)* Expand and categorize default satellite groups\r\n\r\n### 💼 Other\r\n\r\n- Bump version to 0.1.20\r\n- *(deps)* Bump openssl from 0.10.77 to 0.10.78 (#36)\r\n- *(deps)* Bump rand from 0.8.5 to 0.8.6 (#37)\r\n- *(deps)* Bump rustls-webpki from 0.103.12 to 0.103.13 (#38)\r\n\r\n### 🚜 Refactor\r\n\r\n- *(coordinates)* Centralize WGS84 constants\r\n\r\n### 📚 Documentation\r\n\r\n- Specify CelesTrak as the source for auto TLE updates\r\n- *(config)* Synchronize satellite group examples in documentation\r\n\r\n### ⚡ Performance\r\n\r\n- Parallelize object prediction and UI drawing using Rayon\r\n- *(utils)* Parallelize ground track and sky track calculations\r\n\r\n### ⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks\r\n\r\n- *(config)* Remove NOAA from default satellite groups\r\n- *(config)* Add Active and Analyst satellite groups to defaults"
}
